<section class="section acttwo" aria-labelledby="acttwo-title">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="acttwo__inner reveal">
      <h2 class="acttwo__title" id="acttwo-title">
        We're the only party in the room paid to be right, not to install.
      </h2>

      <p class="acttwo__body">
        Energy Plus is an <span class="em">Independent Energy Solutions
        Partner</span>. We don't manufacture equipment and we don't sell a box.
        We diagnose your building's full electrical and thermal picture, then
        design a program around what your building actually needs, using
        whatever vendors and technologies fit, including the ones you already
        have.
      </p>
      <p class="acttwo__body">
        That independence is the whole point. When we tell you where your money
        is leaking, there is no product hiding behind the diagnosis. We have
        nothing to install unless the building's own meter says it is worth
        installing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

